// Generated by CMake at configure time (see Source/CMakeLists.txt) - embeds the app icon into
// ChessAssist.exe, so it shows up in File Explorer/the taskbar/shortcuts, not just the window
// titlebar (which AppWindow::SetWindowIcon() sets separately, at runtime, from the same PNG).
// The first ICON resource in a .rc file becomes the .exe's default icon by Windows convention.
IDI_ICON1 ICON "@CHESSASSIST_ICON_PATH@"
